SUMMARY:Occupational Hazard: The First Coral Reefers
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Occupational Hazard: The First Coral Reefers is a feature docum
 entary that journeys back to the 1970s and early 1980s to tell the story o
 f Jimmy Buffett’s original Coral Reefer Band. Set against the creative b
 ackdrop of Key West\, the film explores the musicians\, friendships\, tour
 ing years\, and studio sessions that helped shape Buffett’s legendary so
 und.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/4a65b5cb-9c0d-
 5860-9e8c-dc82dbea8195\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
